  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.7.0 supports 16-bit images of PictureSharp 0.9.0: with DecoderOptions.PreserveBitDepth, HEIC coded with more than 8 bits (and such gain maps) decodes to Rgba64; HeifEncoderOptions.BitDepth (HeifBitDepth Auto, UpTo8, Ten) writes 16-bit images as HEVC Main 10. HeifEdits render 8-bit images. Requires PictureSharp 0.9.0. 8-bit output is unchanged. Notes: https://github.com/art-ix/PictureSharp.Heif/blob/v0.7.0/docs/releases/release-0.7.0.md",
